  "pitfalls": [
    "Compare the refresh token with the stored one; a valid signature alone cannot revoke it.",
    "Refresh once at a time in the client; parallel refreshes can invalidate each other.",
    "Overwrite the stored verification hash on every resend, so only the newest link works."
  ],
